{title: Kassandra}
{artist: José Antonio Bordell}
{year: 1992}
{key: Bm}
{time: 4/4}

{define: Bm base-fret 1 frets 4 2 2 2}
{define: G base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 2}
{define: D base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 0}
{define: F#m base-fret 1 frets 2 1 2 0}
{define: Em base-fret 1 frets 0 4 0 2}

[Bm]·  · · · | [G]· · · · | [Bm]·  · · · | [G]· · · ·

Es[D]píritu del viento, [F#m]hija de la luna,
A[G]mante solitaria... que [Em]grita en el silencio
Guar[F#m]dando el sentimiento... en [Bm]soledad

[Bm]Halo de misterio, sal[F#m]vaje es tu belleza
Fan[G]tasmas del camino... a[Em]doptan tu existencia
Gi[F#m]tana, gi[Bm]tana

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Bm]Ahh   [F#m]Ahh
[Bm]Ahh   [F#m]Ahh
